{'symbol': 'WST', 'date': '2022-02-17 06:00:00', 'title': 'WEST ANNOUNCES FOURTH-QUARTER AND FULL-YEAR 2021 RESULTS', 'text': 'EXTON, PA., FEB. 17, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WEST PHARMACEUTICAL SERVICES, INC. (NYSE: WST) TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THE FOURTH-QUARTER AND FULL-YEAR 2021 AND INTRODUCED FULL-YEAR 2022 FINANCIAL GUIDANCE. FOURTH-QUARTER AND FULL-YEAR 2021 SUMMARY (COMPARISONS TO PRIOR-YEAR PERIOD) FOURTH-QUARTER 2021 NET SALES OF $730.8 MILLION GREW 26.0%; ORGANIC SALES GROWTH WAS 28.3%.'}